flow v0
columns side main stop

section "Issue stage"
text maintainer col=main "A maintainer adds the first label"
pill needs-preparation tone=muted
box issue-preparer "writes scope and criteria" tone=agent
pill prep-stop "needs-human" col=stop row=issue-preparer tone=stop
pill ready col=main tone=done

section "Pull-request stage"
box implementer "codes, checks, opens the PR" tone=agent
pill needs-review tone=agent
box reviewer "reviews the exact head SHA" tone=agent
pill needs-changes col=side row=reviewer tone=rework
pill ready-to-merge col=main tone=done
box integrator "updates base, checks, merges" tone=agent
end merged "Merged · issue closed"
panel stop col=stop row=reviewer span=3 tone=stop
  strong "Stop"
  pill needs-human
  muted "or an “Action needed” comment"
  rule
  text "A person decides and adds the trigger label of any role"
  muted "After blocked, the same role retries"

maintainer --> needs-preparation
needs-preparation --> issue-preparer : picks up
issue-preparer --> ready tone=done : prepared
issue-preparer --> prep-stop tone=stop : stops
ready --> implementer : takes
implementer --> needs-review : opens PR · handed-off
needs-review --> reviewer
reviewer --> ready-to-merge tone=done : approves
ready-to-merge --> integrator
integrator --> merged : merges
reviewer --> needs-changes tone=rework : requests changes
ready-to-merge -.-> needs-changes tone=rework to=bottom.2 : on-conflict · launcher
integrator --> needs-changes tone=rework to=bottom.1 : requests changes
needs-changes --> implementer tone=rework from=top to=left label=end : revises same PR
implementer --> stop tone=stop : blocked
reviewer --> stop tone=stop : blocked
integrator --> stop tone=stop : blocked · maintainer merge
